{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_08_end","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_08","title":"愿跟随主","storyCode":"HE-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"86c5fa9f3077481abc48f93e14079f5791a33d40045dea9c5ec44e704ea43ccb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"孩子们带来了他们暖洋洋的被褥。他们说，给这个叔叔盖上吧，他睡在这里会着凉的。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我们对生活应该是有所憧憬的。\n这话说起来好奇怪，这难道不是理所当然的吗？\n如果对生活没有半点期待，那我们又为什么要拥有生命，降生在这世上呢？总不至于就是为了来受苦的吧？\n你看，孩子们就不会考虑这样奇怪的问题。\n童年是多么无忧无虑的一段时光啊，只有脱离童年的人，才能明白那时候的好。\n这话放在少年、青年时，也都适用。当时总觉得有许多烦恼，可等之后回头再看看，那时候的小烦恼，算得了什么？\n那个时候，我们都有使不完的力气，总想去做点什么，总相信生活能越来越好。\n我们是如此认真，如此努力地在生活。\n真奇怪，所有事情难道不是都应该越来越好吗？\n很难说是从什么时候开始，我像是已经丧失了憧憬未来的力气。\n能容纳我的空间越来越窄小，能供我呼吸的空气越来越稀薄。我的生活变得沉重，变得能够看到尽头，变得......不再有希望。\n就像从山上向下滚落的石头。\n谁都知道石头不会停止，只会不断下落。\n直到摔个粉碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的花......都没了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再往前走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此处建筑结构遭到多次破坏，具有高度不稳定性......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒，回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，费德里科先生......我想......再找找看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说过的，这里没有你想要的花了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我就是想确认......所有的花都死了。没有一朵......任何一朵......幸运地得救。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无法解析你的行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我亲手种出的花......代表友谊和希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可人们早就不再在意这些，没有人再关注花期，他们遗忘了最不该忘记的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道不可笑吗？竟然有人怀疑莱蒙德会放火，就因为他是萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们明明在一起生活了这么久。越是困难的时刻，我们越该相互依偎......这是主教阁下说的话。我很想相信......我本该相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而事实就摆在我面前，我无法扭过头去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为何隔阂始终存在？人与人是不是注定无法彼此理解？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一点点的混乱，就足以让表面上的秩序走向崩塌，而一旦陷入混乱，人们就会互相伤害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了......我已经忍耐够久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"克莱芒跌跌撞撞地来到了被大火烧毁的圣像面前。\n那里没有第二朵幸运的花，只有一个破旧的木盘，里面盛着几片干瘪的面包。\n他将那气味有些古怪的面包放入口中咀嚼。\n是略有些腥咸，带着海潮一样苦涩的滋味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳，难吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒，把你手中的东西放下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下？这可不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨夜，我本想去告解，结果无意中听到主教阁下的计划......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来想，至少杰拉尔德他们不用参与进来，他们本来就要走了不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但为什么......最后会变成这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会吃完这些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你并不是为了延续自己的生命。为何还要尝试转化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想求一个答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，这世上到底有没有能救我们的存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"费德里科知道，自己现在必须要阻止眼前的这个人。\n但现实是，他站在原地没有动。\n几步之外，阿尔图罗奏响了她的乐器，琴声划破寂静的帷幕，其中的情感费德里科不明白，也从不试图明白。\n只是头一次，执行者无法掌控自己的行动。\n他开始无法理解自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"为什么？\n为什么他没有在见到对方的第一时间就动手？\n为什么这个瘦弱的男人吃下了可以把人变成怪物的东西，现在却什么都没有发生？\n乐曲被拉高了一个音调。\n音符间弥散的沉默像是某种笑话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......这是，血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这算什么，只是这样而已吗？只是，咳咳，只是这样，算什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼吸频率加快，刚刚的撞击有造成下呼吸道或肺部出血的可能性，不采取措施的话可能引发窒息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你需要立刻接受治疗。在此之前，我会先对你进行急救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，咳咳、我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"克莱芒抬手捂住嘴，尽量压低咳嗽的声音。\n但血仍然很快溢出手掌，带着令人不舒服的黏腻，顺着指缝往下淌。\n他踉跄着后退一步，摔倒在破损的圣像前。\n被他烧毁的圣像这时仿佛又接纳了他这个失去了力气的凶手，圣像的断臂落在两侧，好似一个轻柔的抱拥。\n克莱芒感到一阵奇异的温暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不是什么事都没有吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"结果连这个也是假的，主教阁下他受到了欺骗，根本没有什么神明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你吃下的东西是出自海洋的某种残渣，有极大概率引起生理层面上的变异，但从来都与你口中的神明无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......多可笑啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的状态很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"依照目前的速度恶化下去，你将会进入休克状态，死亡的风险很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？那真......不错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你想要留下任何遗嘱，我可以作为你的遗嘱执行人为你服务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"遗嘱......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没有什么要留下的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰人......我们的乐园是虚假的，你们的信仰是虚假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"友谊、信赖、期盼、未来......什么都没有了，没人能真的得救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有人......没有人能真正获得救赎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"这是一种选择吗？这是某种好的结局吗？\n执行者站在原地，没有再上前。\n不论如何，所有的苦痛都逐渐远去。\n疲惫的花匠终于合上眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"余音还在回荡，我还能感受到......最后一刻琴弦传导至指尖的震颤，尖锐得几乎能割破皮肤的尾音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是最初，那旋律平静如涓流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个原本平凡的人，用自己的生命证明了一件事——并不存在什么拯救者。他顽强的精神战胜了变化中的肉体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多么美妙的音乐......这就是人类坚韧又自由的精神，与那些可悲的海洋生物截然不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这首曲子将把他的故事带给所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们将理解他的情感，称颂他的意志，赞美他的勇气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒·杜波瓦将被世人铭记。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你说是不是，费德里科？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i12"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你会在那里多留一会，毕竟你好像十分在意那位死者......甚至认为他的事务优先级高于对我的追捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你学会哀怜了吗？还是说，你依然和过去一样，识别不出他人的喜怒哀乐，与众人格格不入？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"通缉犯阿尔图罗，你的源石技艺又一次引导了他人的死亡。我不可能放过射程范围内最大的威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"依据拉特兰律法，你的刑期会再次增加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"求死是他的个人意志，即使没有我的演奏，他也会走上这条路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一次又一次，我只不过揭示了这些可怜人内心的疮疤，旁人却要扭过头去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也和其他人一样，被他的经历刺痛了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你是不是至今仍然不理解无法按捺的冲动？像那位主教坚持走上一条荆棘之路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......像我不能自已地想要演奏他们的情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的确不能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"理解与否，并不影响律法的执行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我是为了克莱芒得到应有的处置而前往圣堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他罪不至死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想拯救一个意图自毁的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道你没有发现吗？这个念头并不合乎逻辑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒说，在看似完美的事物上，伤痕一旦出现就无法挽回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我会验证这句话的正确性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你好像确实变得有趣了那么一点点......只是一点点而已。或许等下次见面的时候，我就能弹奏出你的思绪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，我该结束这趟旅程了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大贵族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问，是阿尔图罗小姐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭候多时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大贵族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，明明是我们主动邀请您做客，我却来得有些迟了，这里非常难找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大贵族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔，我是不是来得不是时候？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这真是，看一眼就会让人头痛三天的画面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你怎么和阿尔图罗对上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大贵族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，拉特兰的先生们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，这位......女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（费德里科，她身上的纹章属于某位选帝侯！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在不能直接对阿尔图罗动手，这可能会影响拉特兰和莱塔尼亚之间的关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我拒绝你的提议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们商量好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如，费德里科，我给你一次机会，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果想要对我举起铳，你该瞄准的是这里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑发女人捧起执行者握紧铳的手。\n她让铳口抵住自己的前额。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要扣下扳机，铳的弹丸就会贯穿我的头颅，从此之后，我就不会再是你的困扰......费德里科，你想要这么做吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要试试看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要将通缉犯逮捕，非必要情况，一般不建议直接击毙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的说辞很合理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真动手？！都和你说了会是国际问题了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，奥伦，好像事情没那么严重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她不会有事。你不了解这个女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，只是玩一个小游戏罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大贵族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗小姐，这是某种源石技艺的应用效果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大贵族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便如此，刚刚的举动也太过危险了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您的关心，如果还有下一次，我会注意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，就当作我给你留下的线索吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有想过，演奏从未停止，只是你听不见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是不到最精彩最宏大的段落时，所有人都听不见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，乐声已尽，我也该再次出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰的诸位，下次再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大贵族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们先失陪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然真的就这么站着，放人走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为至少得要我和里凯莱两个人一起上，才能把你拦下来呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很吵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？哎，费德里科，你去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他往钟塔外围走了，我记得那边应该是......这里的墓地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，别看了，没出什么事就好。我们也还有事要做呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科哥哥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗姐姐......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不在呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我们再去其他地方找！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，怎么有一个叔叔躺在这里呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，这个叔叔睡着啦，我们不要吵醒他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识这个叔叔耶，他会种好漂亮的花，就是妈妈经常带回家，插在瓶子里的那种！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨拉，你干嘛呀，那个是妈妈给我们的欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，叔叔在这里睡觉，会着凉的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈说，好孩子要学会感、感际。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是感激啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那就暂时借给叔叔好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，希望叔叔睡醒之后，能继续种出好多好多好看的花......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定可以的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
